00:36:50,666 --> 00:36:53,544
And I just had to have that in the movie

589
00:36:53,753 --> 00:36:57,965
because it was something I always loved when I saw Nosferatu

590
00:36:58,174 --> 00:36:59,967
which , as I 've said

