592
00:37:03,346 --> 00:37:04,889
And a silent movie .

593
00:37:05,098 --> 00:37:08,935
Mina , what is it ? It 's the most exciting day of my life

594
00:37:10,144 --> 00:37:12,105
You don 't seem to care .

595
00:37:12,313 --> 00:37:15,358
It 's just that I 'm so terribly worried about Jonathan .

596
00:37:15,566 --> 00:37:17,693
This letter I received is so - -

597
00:37:18,528 --> 00:37:21,072
This is the work of Andrew and Tom .

598
00:37:21,280 --> 00:37:25,410
The garden , again , is built into the swimming pool

