617
00:38:53,581 --> 00:38:54,624
Crew uneasy .

618
00:38:55,583 --> 00:38:58,377
Believe someone or something

619
00:38:58,586 --> 00:39:00,880
Is aboard the ship with us .

620
00:39:15,561 --> 00:39:19,524
You know , all hell is breaking loose in the asylum

621
00:39:19,732 --> 00:39:24,862
because the coming of the boat - - Again , the metaphor is that

622
00:39:25,071 --> 00:39:27,907
the boat is expressed by boat-like movement

623
00:39:28,115 --> 00:39:31,536
even in a rock-solid place like an asylum .

624
00:39:31,744 --> 00:39:36,707
But he 's getting so stoked , Renfield , that his master is coming .

625
00:39:38,209 --> 00:39:43,297
And , again , authentically told from the book

626
00:39:43,923 --> 00:39:50,304
Seward is shooting up himself with morphine .

627
00:39:50,513 --> 00:39:54,976
And the emotion of all the characters is being intensified

628
00:39:55,184 --> 00:39:59,397
by the mere approach of this prince of darkness

629
00:40:00,356 --> 00:40:05,194
who arrives on the shore in England

630
00:40:05,403 --> 00:40:11,409
