631
00:40:11,617 --> 00:40:14,495
So that it 's totally a dead ship .

632
00:40:16,372 --> 00:40:19,750
And now using a technique called pixilation

633
00:40:19,959 --> 00:40:22,753
in which we just shot a few frames at a time

634
00:40:22,962 --> 00:40:26,757
to try to give a curious point-of-view look

635
00:40:26,966 --> 00:40:30,636
