636
00:40:30,845 --> 00:40:33,347
Roman shot that pixilation .

637
00:40:33,556 --> 00:40:36,267
I think it was a term

638
00:40:36,475 --> 00:40:40,104
that comes from certain experimental filmmakers

639
00:40:40,313 --> 00:40:43,232
maybe in the San Francisco period in the ' 50s .

640
00:40:45,693 --> 00:40:49,280
It 's interesting that , you know , a filmmaker , you know

641
00:40:49,488 --> 00:40:53,075
