642
00:40:53,284 --> 00:40:55,077
experimental films from San Francisco .

643
00:40:55,286 --> 00:40:56,996
Jordan Belson , Stan Brakhage

644
00:40:57,204 --> 00:41:01,292
the great works of G. W. Pabst and Murnau

645
00:41:01,500 --> 00:41:04,128
and the other Dracula stories .

646
00:41:04,337 --> 00:41:05,504
Carl Dreyer .

647
00:41:05,713 --> 00:41:09,759
And all of us are really sort of , like , just receiving this

648
00:41:09,967 --> 00:41:14,221
and then it 's all mixed up in our own personalities and souls .

649
00:41:14,430 --> 00:41:17,224
And then we put it out in some new form .

650
00:41:17,433 --> 00:41:21,145
It 's a process of gathering from everyone

651
00:41:21,354 --> 00:41:23,022
and our own life experience

652
00:41:23,230 --> 00:41:25,858
and then , like , putting it together

653
00:41:26,067 --> 00:41:29,195
in a form that it had never existed before .

654
00:41:29,403 --> 00:41:32,615
And , you know , I always tell the young filmmakers I meet

655
00:41:32,823 --> 00:41:36,827
that , you know , the different writers , Balzac , and the different filmmakers

656
00:41:37,036 --> 00:41:39,955
they want you to take what they 've done

657
00:41:40,164 --> 00:41:44,251
and if they want , just copy it . Because you never really copy it .

658
00:41:44,460 --> 00:41:46,212
It 's impossible for you to copy it .

659
00:41:46,420 --> 00:41:50,883
You put it out in your own form , and then that makes the - -

660
00:41:51,092 --> 00:41:52,677
I read that once , of Balzac , saying :

661
00:41:52,885 --> 00:41:54,970
" Oh , we want the young writers to take from us

662
00:41:55,179 --> 00:41:57,556
because if they take from us and put it in their work

663
00:41:57,765 --> 00:41:58,891
then we 'll be immortal . "

664
00:41:59,100 --> 00:42:00,893
And that is the tradition .

665
00:42:01,102 --> 00:42:05,398
You 're inspired by others , and then , hopefully , if we 're fortunate

666
00:42:05,606 --> 00:42:08,317
we inspire people who come after them .

667
00:42:18,160 --> 00:42:21,580
I 'm a little surprised by this movie , is - -

