I am here to do your bidding .

694
00:43:56,008 --> 00:43:59,261
Master ! I am here !

695
00:44:00,763 --> 00:44:03,057
I have worshiped you .

696
00:44:05,935 --> 00:44:08,729
Contrary to some beliefs , the vampire

